translation.mcpMarketplace.accessScope.appRegistrationDisconnect	Disconnects this server from the PagerDuty app registration. Enter your own OAuth client ID and secret below.
translation.mcpMarketplace.accessScope.appRegistrationClientRequired	Organization access needs its own OAuth client ID; this server no longer uses the app registration
translation.mcpMarketplace.accessScope.appRegistrationClientRequired_enterprise	Enterprise access needs its own OAuth client ID; this server no longer uses the app registration
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.rowDescription	Choose what Devin can do in your Microsoft 365 account. Each permission unlocks specific tools, and Devin only sees the tools your permissions allow. Required permissions are always included.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.offlineAccess	Keeps Devin connected in the background so you don\'t have to sign in again.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.userRead	Lets Devin identify your account (name and email).
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.calendarsReadBasic	Lets Devin list and open your events (time, title, location, attendees), without descriptions or attachments.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.calendarsRead	Lets Devin list and open your events, including descriptions.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.calendarsReadWrite	Lets Devin also create, update and delete events on your calendar.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.userReadBasicAll	Lets Devin search people in your organization and read their basic profile (name, email, job title).
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.userReadAll	Also lets Devin look up someone\'s manager. Requires admin consent.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.directoryReadAll	Lets Devin search people and look up managers through directory data. Requires admin consent.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.filesRead	Lets Devin browse your OneDrive and read file contents.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.filesReadWrite	Lets Devin also upload files, create folders, delete files and open files from sharing links.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.filesReadAll	Same as Files.Read, through a broader permission covering all files you can access. Only needed if your admin grants this one instead.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.filesReadWriteAll	Same as Files.ReadWrite, through a broader permission covering all files you can access. Only needed if your admin grants this one instead.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.sitesReadAll	Same as Files.Read, through a SharePoint-wide permission. Only needed if your admin grants this one instead.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.sitesReadWriteAll	Same as Files.ReadWrite, through a SharePoint-wide permission. Only needed if your admin grants this one instead.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.mailReadBasic	Lets Devin list your mail folders only. Reading emails needs Mail.Read.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.mailRead	Lets Devin list, search and read your emails and folders.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.mailReadWrite	Lets Devin also create drafts, archive, move and mark emails as read. Does not allow sending.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.mailSend	Lets Devin send emails as you.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.contactsRead	Lets Devin list and read your Outlook contacts.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.contactsReadWrite	Lets Devin also create, update and delete your contacts.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.teamReadBasicAll	Lets Devin list the teams you\'re a member of.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.channelReadBasicAll	Lets Devin list the channels in your teams, to find where to post.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.teamworkTagRead	Lets Devin list the tags of your teams so it can @mention a tag in a channel post. Requires admin consent.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.chatReadBasic	Lets Devin list your chats and their members. Does not allow reading messages.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.chatCreate	Together with ChatMessage.Send, lets Devin start a 1:1 chat and send someone a direct message.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.channelMessageSend	Lets Devin post messages as you in team channels.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.channelMessageReadAll	Lets Devin read posts and replies in the team channels you can access. Requires admin consent.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.chatMessageSend	Lets Devin send messages as you in your existing chats.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.chatRead	Alternative to Chat.ReadBasic for listing chats and members. Devin has no tool to read messages.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.chatReadWrite	Lets Devin list chats and send messages in existing chats. Broader than needed: prefer Chat.ReadBasic and ChatMessage.Send.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.tasksRead	Lets Devin read your To Do lists and tasks.
translation.mcpMarketplace.microsoft365Scopes.descriptions.tasksReadWrite	Lets Devin also create, update, complete and delete your tasks.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.rowDescription	Choose what Devin can do in your Google account. Each permission unlocks specific tools, and Devin only sees the tools your permissions allow. Required permissions are always included.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.openid	Lets Devin identify your Google account.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.userinfoEmail	Lets Devin see the email address of your Google account.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.gmailReadonly	Lets Devin search and read your Gmail messages, drafts, labels and attachments.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.gmailModify	Lets Devin create and send drafts, reply and forward, and archive, trash and label your Gmail messages.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.calendarReadonly	Lets Devin list your calendars and read your events.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.calendarEvents	Lets Devin create, update and delete events and RSVP to invitations.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.contactsReadonly	Lets Devin search your Google Contacts.
translation.mcpMarketplace.googleProductivityScopes.descriptions.contactsOtherReadonly	Lets Devin search the people you have emailed who are not saved as contacts.
