translation.notificationInbox.server.teamsConnectionNeedsAttention.body.automation_channel_lost	A Microsoft Teams automation stopped receiving messages from its channel. Devin AI may have been removed from the team, the channel may have been deleted, or a Teams admin may have revoked Devin's channel permissions. Add Devin AI back to the team, or update the automation.
translation.notificationInbox.server.teamsConnectionNeedsAttention.body.bot_blocked	Devin can't reply or post in Microsoft Teams because a Teams admin blocked the Devin AI app. Ask a Teams admin to allow the Devin AI app in the Teams admin center (Teams apps > Manage apps).
